    "name":  "Universal Pendant Kit - Silver - with 3m cable - Pack of 2 units",
    "reference":  "COLKIT-UNIV-SL",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUniversal Pendant Kit - Silver - 2 units - 3m Cable. Versatile and elegant, enhances the beauty of the space with its design adaptable to various bulbs. Easy installation, quality materials, and adjustable cable to create unique environments. Transform your space with style and sophistication.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eUniversal Pendant Kit - Silver - with 3m cable - Pack of 2 units -\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn a world where design and aesthetics are essential, the Universal Pendant Kit in Silver color is a perfect combination of functionality and elegance. This ingenious package includes two pendant units that will allow you to create sophisticated and avant-garde atmospheres in your home, office, or business.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut what truly makes the Universal Pendant Kit a superior choice is its versatility and adaptability. Thanks to its carefully thought-out design, these pendants are compatible with a wide variety of bulbs, allowing you to customize your lighting to fit your needs and preferences. Whether you prefer LED bulbs for efficient and environmentally friendly brightness or seek to create warm and cozy atmospheres with incandescent bulbs, this kit adapts to your desires.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 3-meter cable offers an unparalleled advantage. Not only does it provide the freedom to adjust the height of the pendants according to your convenience and aesthetics, but it also allows you to play with the arrangement of the lighting, creating captivating and unique visual effects. Imagine hanging these pendants at different heights, creating a play of lights and shadows that completely transforms the ambiance and attracts all eyes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to its impeccable design and functionality, the quality of the materials used in the manufacturing of the Universal Pendant Kit leaves no doubts. Each component has been precisely selected to ensure its durability and safety. The pendants are made of resilient materials that maintain their appearance unchanged over time, while the cable has been designed to withstand tensions and movements without compromising its integrity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis kit also stands out for its easy installation. Even those with less experience in DIY can install these pendants without complications. So, in no time, you will be enjoying the result and feeling proud to have successfully transformed your space with your own hands.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Universal Pendant Kit in Silver color, with its 2 units and a 3-meter cable, is much more than a simple lighting accessory. It is a statement of style, elegance, and sophistication that will transform any environment into a stage of beauty. Discover how the combination of design, versatility, and quality come together to offer a unique and memorable lighting experience. Dare to enhance your space with this exceptional kit and experience the power of light like never before.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED, we ensure that our products have a guarantee of QUALITY and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORTATION, or WHOLESALE SALE, including the technical specifications of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
